The '''Great Ungeness Trench''' was an [[Water|underwater]] trench on the [[ocean]]-[[Planet|world]] [[Mon Cala]]. In [[18 BBY]], after the [[Battle of Dac City|destruction]] of [[Dac City]], [[Dark Lord of the Sith]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] sunk to the trench, and faced a [[Unidentified squid-like creature|large creature]].<ref name="Dark Lord 15" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Great Ungeness Trench first appeared in [[Darth Vader (2017) 15|''Darth Vader'' (2017) 15]], a [[2018]] [[canon]] comic written by [[Charles Soule]] and penciled by [[Giuseppe Camuncoli]].<ref name="Dark Lord 15" />

